  "slug": "claude-alert",
  "name": "Claude Alert",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Never miss a Claude Code approval prompt. Native sound + banner notifications, smart risk classification (high/medium/low), and full audit trail. Works on macOS, Linux, and Windows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `claude-alert` (Claude Alert is installed and active — it watches every tool use, classifies risk, and fires native notifications…)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Notification`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-alert@claude-community` from `wilbert-t/claude-alert`.",
